WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.324 --> 00:00:03.933
davidlefkowitz.com — the music of composer David S. Lefkowitz.

2
00:00:03.933 --> 00:00:20.704
Two hundred catalog entries, twenty-one albums, thirty-four essays — one home.

3
00:00:20.704 --> 00:00:39.412
From Eastman, Penn, and Cornell to thirty-one years teaching at UCLA.

4
00:00:39.412 --> 00:00:44.635
The Recordings: every album from 1993 to 2025, covers and all.

5
00:00:44.635 --> 00:01:00.939
Bridge, Yarlung, Albany, Navona — labels that keep coming back.

6
00:01:00.939 --> 00:01:05.204
The crown jewel: 52 Preludes and Fugues asking what a fugue means in a post-tonal world.

7
00:01:05.204 --> 00:01:21.608
Four concert pianists, a cantor — and a piano prepared with chopsticks and playing cards.

8
00:01:21.608 --> 00:01:25.272
The newest release: Green Mountains, Now Black, for Quartet Integra.

9
00:01:25.272 --> 00:01:28.933
Monteverdi's love duets woven against the Los Angeles fires of 2025.

10
00:01:28.933 --> 00:01:44.913
Every album: one click to listen, on any service.

11
00:01:44.913 --> 00:02:05.682
The complete catalog — searchable by title, instrument, or ensemble.

12
00:02:05.682 --> 00:02:24.521
Each work carries its program note — Ruminations, after Rumi, for the Sibelius Piano Trio.

13
00:02:24.521 --> 00:02:41.865
Notes link to recordings, recordings link back — the catalog is one connected web.

14
00:02:41.865 --> 00:02:58.937
Thirty-four essays on fugues, Bach, and musical life — all preserved.

15
00:02:58.937 --> 00:03:17.174
Formatting, links, and each essay's closing thought — intact.

16
00:03:17.174 --> 00:03:34.221
Media: portrait and performance photography, with credits, ready for press use.

17
00:03:34.221 --> 00:03:51.391
For Your Consideration: the Preludes and Fugues, with the reviews to match.

18
00:03:51.391 --> 00:04:07.264
And one click to reach David himself.

19
00:04:07.264 --> 00:04:10.273
davidlefkowitz.com — every note where it belongs.

